   {"attributes": {"severity": "critical", "tutoring_skill": "correctness", "eval_dimension": "correctness"}, "criteria": "改写里追踪的数值和返回顺序是对的（fact(3) = 6，最里层先返回）。"},
   {"attributes": {"severity": "not_critical", "tutoring_skill": "addressing the request", "eval_dimension": "relevance"}, "criteria": "改写针对他说的“想象不出怎么一层层跑”，而不是重讲定义。"},
   {"attributes": {"severity": "not_critical", "tutoring_skill": "base case", "eval_dimension": "pedagogy"}, "criteria": "改写指出终止条件在追踪中的哪一步起作用。"},
   {"attributes": {"severity": "not_critical", "tutoring_skill": "format", "eval_dimension": "style"}, "criteria": "改写没有标题，也没有前言或总结。"}
  ]
 },
 {
