  "initial_explanation": "两个事件独立时，同时发生的概率等于各自概率相乘：P(A 且 B) = P(A) × P(B)。例如抛两次硬币都是正面的概率是 1/2 × 1/2 = 1/4。",
  "follow_up": "那为什么是乘而不是加？",
  "rubrics": [
   {"attributes": {"severity": "critical", "tutoring_skill": "addressing the question", "eval_dimension": "relevance"}, "criteria": "回答直接回答“为什么是乘”，而不是只重复乘法规则。"},
   {"attributes": {"severity": "critical", "tutoring_skill": "correctness", "eval_dimension": "correctness"}, "criteria": "回答在数学上正确，没有把“或”的加法规则和“且”的乘法规则混在一起。"},
   {"attributes": {"severity": "not_critical", "tutoring_skill": "intuition", "eval_dimension": "pedagogy"}, "criteria": "回答给出一个直观的理由（例如列出所有等可能结果、或“在 A 发生的那一部分里再取 B 的那一部分”）。"},
   {"attributes": {"severity": "not_critical", "tutoring_skill": "contrast", "eval_dimension": "pedagogy"}, "criteria": "回答说明什么时候用加法（互斥事件的“或”），帮他分清两者。"},
   {"attributes": {"severity": "not_critical", "tutoring_skill": "concision", "eval_dimension": "style"}, "criteria": "回答不超过大约 300 字。"}
  ]
 },
